		{
			dependencies: ["4B4C5E3399DD5C61"]
			description: [
				"This chapter has two paths. Both are technically optional, but they are highly recommended."
				""
				"The path on the left leads you down Create's &6High Logistics&r line, which gives you the tools to expand your factory's logistics in extremely powerful ways. &6Smart storage&r systems, \"ziplines\" (&6zipchains&r?), &6delivery networks&r, &6automatic crafting&r, and &6so much more&r."
				""
				"The path on the right leads you down Create's &6Train&r line, which opens up the best long-range transportation option in the game (and the coolest). Trains can &6move through unloaded chunks&r, making your resource drill setups much more worth it and much more viable long-term. Just make sure your &6stations either end are always loaded&r! FTB Chunks comes with a chunkloading feature, so make good use of it."
			]
			id: "248FA393E5FE7978"
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Let's flesh out that factory"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3B44CCA642BDFFCC"
