		{
			dependencies: ["72EDAE096642A36E"]
			description: [
				"Packagers are quite simple on the surface - when they're given a &6redstone signal&r, they'll extract &6all items&r from an attached inventory and put it into a Package."
				""
				"Packages are primarily used to transport &6bulk amounts&r of &6assorted goods&r."
				""
				"Inserting a Package &6into&r a Packager will cause the Packager to &6unload the Package's contents&r into its connected inventory, no redstone required."
				""
				"Place a &6Sign&r on a Packager to &6automatically address a package&r to a destination. See the next quests for more information about this."
				""
				"This isn't all Packagers can do! Later in this questline, you'll learn more about them."
			]
