			description: [
				"Stock Tickers allow you to &6order items&r from a storage network. Right-click on a Stock Link &6before placing the Ticker&r to link it to the network."
				""
				"Place a Blaze Burner or a seated mob next to the Ticker to turn it into a &6Stock Keeper&r. "
				""
