		{
			dependencies: ["19EC27132C679F55"]
			description: [
				"Stock Links allow you to &6create a new storage network&r. Place one down on top, or on the side, of a Packager to create a new network."
				""
				"Expand your networks by right-clicking the Stock Link in your hand on an already-placed Stock Link that is part of an existing network. Placing that Stock Link will immediately link it to the network you bound it to."
				""
				"&6Fully powering&r a Stock Link with redstone will &cdisable it&r. &6Partially powering&r it will &6decrease its priority&r."
				""
				"Stock Links do nothing by themselves, but they allow you to integrate many other components to mesh into a &6complex storage network&r!"
			]
