				"A quick method to move Packages around is with Frogports and Chain Conveyors. Packages &6automatically pathfind&r a Chain Conveyor network to their destination Frogport."
				""
				"Packages with an address can be inserted into a Frogport via conventional means, such as with Funnels, or you can place Frogports &6directly on top of Packagers&r."
				""
				"Frogports can &6put Packages on Chain Conveyors&r if the address &cdoesn't&r match the Frogport. They'll &6remove Packages from Chain Conveyors&r if the address &adoes&r match the name of the Frogport."
			]
			id: "06EB543820514CF3"
			subtitle: "Ribbit"
			tasks: [{
				id: "72C9E2CB521B1456"
				item: "create:package_frogport"
