		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72EDAE096642A36E"]
			description: [
				"Right this one's a doozy."
				""
				"Chain Conveyors can be linked together with &6Chains&r. This allows them to &6share rotation&r similarly to a Belt. You can attach shafts above and below them to power the Conveyor, or take power away from them."
				""
				"&6Packages&r can be placed directly on a Conveyor. This will cause them to move around the chain, not really doing much else. That gets fixed in the next quest though, so don't worry."
				""
				"You can also &6attach yourself&r to the chain! Simply right click on a segment of chain with a &6Wrench&r, and off you go! Ziplines in Minecraft!"
			]
