		{
			dependencies: [
				"3DEB2F745105ACB1"
				"2BC7202742BC1535"
			]
			description: [
				"I'm a &6huge&r fan of trains, that's why I've included so many train addons in this modpack."
				""
				"An unfortunate thing I find about Create's trains is that, unlike in games like Factorio or Satisfactory, they're &cdifficult to approach for a new or casual player&r, as by design they can be &acompletely customised&r, but by default they come &cunfit for any purpose&r."
				""
				"This is a problem as trains are an &6integral part to moving resources&r in this modpack, and I don't want it to be a &chard barrier&r to entry for the average player."
				""
				"At some point I want to include some &6example schematics&r for trains and stations that follow some form of &6standard design&r, each example designed for a basic purpose."
				""
				"The obvious ones are a &6locomotive&r, a &6fluid carriage&r, and a &6cargo carriage&r, but &6passenger designs&r would also be nice, especially to give the mods that enhance the passenger experience some more spotlight."
			]
			id: "1450681E4476E1F7"
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "Dev notes about the Train section of this chapter"
